{"from": "text:genesis-18-6", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-13-33-leaven-three-measures", "note": "Cross-reference: Genesis 18:6 (WEB) has Abraham order 'three seahs of fine meal' - the same three-measure batch in the Sarah story. A biblical text is not independent evidence."}
{"from": "text:leviticus-11-9", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-13-48-good-bad-fish-sorted", "note": "Cross-reference: Leviticus 11:9 (WEB) permits only fish 'that has fins and scales' - the kosher rule that would make a mixed Galilee catch genuinely 'good' and 'bad'. A biblical text is not independent evidence."}
{"from": "text:isaiah-6-9-10", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-13-14-15-isaiah-6-quoted", "note": "Cross-reference: Isaiah 6:9-10 (WEB) is the passage Matthew cites as fulfilled. A biblical text is not independent evidence for the citation practice."}
{"from": "text:josephus-antiquities-20", "type": "attests", "to": "person:james-brother-of-jesus", "grade": "A", "note": "Josephus names James as the brother of Jesus who was called Christ (reused from ch 12)."}
{"from": "artifact:james-ossuary", "type": "attests", "to": "person:james-brother-of-jesus", "grade": "D", "note": "The ossuary is claimed to be that of James the Just, brother of Jesus; unprovenanced, and its inscription's authenticity is disputed (IAA: modern forgery; trial verdict: guilt not proven) (reused from ch 12)."}
{"from": "artifact:james-ossuary", "type": "attests", "to": "person:jesus-of-nazareth", "grade": "D", "note": "The inscription, if authentic, names Jesus (Yeshua) as James's brother; the ossuary is unprovenanced and its authenticity is disputed (reused from ch 12)."}
{"from": "text:josephus-ant-18-sepphoris", "type": "attests", "to": "claim:mt-13-55-tekton-son", "grade": "C", "note": "Josephus (Ant. 18.27): 'Herod [Antipas] also built a wall about Sepphoris, (which is the security of all Galilee,) and made it the metropolis of the country' - the rebuilding that made Sepphoris a building-craftsman's work market a few kilometres from Nazareth."}
{"from": "text:josephus-ant-18-sepphoris", "type": "documented_by", "to": "source:wikisource-ant18-sepphoris"}
